# nonces burned before signature/ownership verification - failed requests poison their nonce for the legitimate retry

## Steps to Reproduce

1. TODO: Add steps

## Expected Behavior

TODO: Describe expected behavior

## Actual Behavior

TODO: Describe actual behavior

## Symptom

Nonces are burned before signature/ownership verification: check_register_nonce (relay.ml:5225-5243) inserts the nonce before Ed25519 verification and before the alias-binding check (room ops nonce likewise), so a request that fails verification (clock skew, wrong body hash, unbound alias) permanently consumes its nonce; the clients legitimate retry with the same nonce then gets nonce_replay, which reads as an attack rather than a transient failure. Fail-closed, so not a security hole - a misleading failure mode.

## Fix direction

Verify signature first and record the nonce last (as part of the commit step).

## Evidence

Server-core review 2026-09-17.